<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Sources & daily edition</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/admin.css"><style>textarea,input,select{max-width:100%;width:100%}input[type=checkbox]{width:auto}fieldset{margin:16px 0;padding:16px;border:1px solid #666}label{display:block;margin:8px 0}pre{white-space:pre-wrap}summary{cursor:pointer}table{width:100%}td,th{padding:8px;text-align:left}details{margin:12px 0}.registry{overflow:auto}</style></head><body class="admin-body"><div class="admin-layout"><%- include('_sidebar',{page:'collection',totalPending:pending.length}) %><main class="admin-main"><h1>Sources & daily edition</h1><p>Local candidate. No collection or publishing is triggered by viewing this page. Source availability is not worldwide completeness.</p>
<h2>Coverage and retrieval health</h2><p>Gaps: <%= coverage.coverage_gaps.join(' · ') %></p><div class="registry"><table><thead><tr><th>Official source</th><th>Languages / jurisdiction</th><th>State</th><th>Last successful collection</th></tr></thead><tbody><% coverage.sources.forEach(s=>{ const h=coverage.health[s.id]||{}; %><tr><td><%= s.name %></td><td><%= s.languages.join(', ') %> / <%= s.jurisdictions.join(', ') %></td><td><%= h.status||s.status %><%= h.stale?' · report is old':'' %><%= h.backlog?' · backlog '+h.backlog:'' %><br><%= s.reason||s.rights.status %><% if(h.pagination){ %><p>Query window: <%= h.pagination.from||'Full snapshot' %> → <%= h.pagination.to %><br>Pages: <%= h.pagination.pages_fetched %> · <%= h.pagination.date_basis %> · <%= h.pagination.complete?'Window processed; not exhaustive global coverage':'Incomplete: '+h.pagination.incomplete_reason %></p><% } %></td><td><%= h.last_success_at||('No collection in this store; adapter check: '+(s.validation?.checked_at||'not validated')) %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div>
<h2>Write original summaries</h2><p>Imported headlines and links are research leads, not ready-to-publish articles. Write your own summary and record rights. Translation, outbreak geography and official assessments require human source verification. Save here, then review the exact saved revision in the editor. Clinical guidance retains its independent-clinician gate.</p>
<% pending.filter(a=>a.ingestion).forEach(a=>{const o=a.outbreak||{},g=o.location||{}; %><details><summary><%= a.title %> · <%= a.source %><%= a.ingestion.source_changed?' · revised source':'' %></summary><p><a href="<%= a.source_url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read source</a> · Published: <%= a.provenance.published_at||a.provenance.publication_raw||'Unknown' %> · Updated: <%= a.provenance.source_updated_at||'Unknown' %></p><p>Retrieved: <%= a.provenance.retrieved_at %> · First indexed: <%= a.provenance.indexed_at||'Not supplied' %> · Data type: <%= a.data_kind||'news_metadata' %> · Language: <%= a.language||'und' %> · Source dataset period: <%= a.provenance.source_period||'Not supplied' %><%= a.provenance.date_in_future?' · Future source publication date — verify electronic versus issue date before use':'' %></p><p>Story cluster candidate: <%= a.ingestion.cluster_id %> (exact normalized title only; not proof of same event)</p><form method="post" action="/admin/intake/<%= a.id %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= revision(a) %>">
<label>Original summary<textarea name="summary" rows="3" required><%= a.summary %></textarea></label><label>Original article body (basic HTML)<textarea name="body" rows="5" required><%= a.body %></textarea></label><label>Content type<select name="content_kind"><% ['news','clinical','treatment','dosing'].forEach(k=>{ %><option <%= a.content_kind===k?'selected':'' %>><%= k %></option><% }) %></select></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="original_summary" value="yes" <%= a.editorial?.original_summary?'checked':'' %>> I wrote an original attributed summary</label>
<label>Reuse review<select name="rights_status"><% ['unreviewed','reviewed_for_original_summary','permission_obtained'].forEach(k=>{ %><option <%= a.rights.status===k?'selected':'' %>><%= k %></option><% }) %></select></label><label>Rights basis / permission reference URL<input type="url" name="license_url" value="<%= a.rights.license_url||'' %>" required></label><label>Attribution<input name="attribution" value="<%= a.rights.attribution||a.source %>" required></label>
<label><input type="checkbox" name="translation_required" value="yes" <%= a.translation?.required?'checked':'' %>> Summary translates a source</label><label>Original language<input name="original_language" value="<%= a.translation?.original_language||a.language||'' %>"></label><label>Summary language<input name="target_language" value="<%= a.translation?.target_language||'en' %>"></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="translation_reviewed" value="yes" <%= a.editorial?.translation_reviewed?'checked':'' %>> Human translation accuracy review complete</label>
<fieldset><legend>Optional official outbreak / assessment</legend><label>Map layer<select name="event_kind"><option value="">No event map record</option value="outbreak" <%= o.kind==='outbreak'?'selected':'' %>>Emerging diseases</option><option value="official_assessment" <%= o.kind==='official_assessment'?'selected':'' %>>Pandemic watch — official assessment</option></select></label>
<% [['disease','Disease'],['report_url','Official report URL'],['report_date','Report date (YYYY-MM-DD)'],['update_date','Update date'],['onset_date','Onset date — leave unknown blank'],['uncertainty','Uncertainty and data gaps'],['assessment_text','Attributed official assessment — not our prediction'],['assessment_version','Assessment version'],['assessment_date','Assessment date'],['cross_border_evidence','Cross-border spread evidence, or explicitly unknown']].forEach(([key,label])=>{ %><label><%= label %><input name="<%= key %>" value="<%= o[key]||'' %>"></label><% }) %>
<label>Confirmation<select name="confirmation"><% ['under_investigation','suspected','confirmed'].forEach(k=>{ %><option <%= o.confirmation===k?'selected':'' %>><%= k %></option><% }) %></select></label><label>Reported event area<input name="location_name" value="<%= g.name||'' %>"></label><label>Precision<select name="precision"><option>country</option><option <%= g.precision==='region'?'selected':'' %>>region</option></select></label><label>Area centroid latitude (never patient location)<input name="lat" value="<%= g.lat??'' %>"></label><label>Area centroid longitude<input name="lon" value="<%= g.lon??'' %>"></label><label>Official geographic evidence URL<input name="location_evidence" value="<%= g.evidence_url||'' %>"></label></fieldset><label>Correction reason<input name="correction_reason" value="<%= a.correction_reason||'' %>"></label><button>Save draft for exact-revision review</button></form></details><% }) %>
<h2>Daily edition · <%= day %> UTC</h2><p>Select already published, human-reviewed revisions. An empty edition may honestly report no verified updates; no stories are fabricated. Release is a separate explicit action.</p><form method="post" action="/admin/edition/<%= day %>"><% approved.forEach(a=>{ %><label><input type="checkbox" name="ids" value="<%= a.id %>"> <%= a.title %></label><% }) %><label>Editor's note<textarea name="note"><%= edition?.note||'' %></textarea></label><button>Save edition draft</button></form>
<% if(edition){ %><p><strong><%= edition.released_at?'Released':'Draft awaiting review' %></strong> · <%= edition.items.length %> selected articles<%= edition.released_at?' · '+edition.released_at:'' %></p><p><%= edition.note %></p><% if(!edition.released_at){ %><form method="post" action="/admin/edition/<%= day %>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="release"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= editionRevision %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I reviewed this exact edition and its linked article revisions</label><button>Release reviewed edition</button></form><% } %><% } %></main></div></body></html>
